{
  "$schema": "https://jxsuite.com/schema/v1",
  "$id": "StudioSchemaBuilder",
  "$description": "The `schema-builder` form control (specs/extensions.md §9.1): the visual editor for a JSON Schema object, drawn as one card per property. A descriptor names it with `\"ui\": { \"<prop>\": { \"control\": \"schema-builder\" } }`, and `ui/schema-form.ts` mounts it into the empty host its own document announces for that field. The adapter (`surfaces/schema-builder.ts`) hands in the fields already classified and every draft the reader is part-way through typing; `ui/form-controls.ts` decides what a field may be renamed to and what reaches the host's `onChange`. Nothing here reads a schema: a document that re-derived a field's type while drawing would be a second opinion about what one module already owns. **The card is `surfaces/settings-defs.json`'s, part for part.** Data Shapes edits the project's `$defs` and this edits a content type's `schema`; they are the same object with the same six controls per row, so the row vocabulary — `card`, `field-row`, `field-label`, `field-name`, `field-type`, `field-format`, `field-required`, `field-delete`, `nested`, `nested-card`, `nested-add-name`/`-type`/`-button`, `ref-target`, `add-form` — is ONE vocabulary, and the row views it is drawn from are that surface's own types rather than a second declaration of them. What differs is only what encloses it: Data Shapes carries the two-column chrome that chooses WHICH shape is being edited, and this one is handed the object to edit.",
  "tagName": "div",
  "attributes": {
    "part": "builder"
  },
  "style": {
    "$description": "What `.schema-builder`, `.schema-field-list`, `.schema-field-card`, `.schema-field-row`, `.schema-field-nested`, `.schema-field-name-input`, `.schema-nested-add`, `.schema-nested-add-name` and `.schema-add-field` said in `styles/overlays.css`, keyed on `part` and re-pointed at the studio token layer — the same translation `surfaces/settings-defs.json` carries, because it is the same card. Two values could not come with them. `.schema-field-card--nested` read `var(--spectrum-gray-300, #444)`, and the caption was an `sp-field-label` at whatever size Spectrum drew it; a document is mounted in the pane rather than inside `<sp-theme>`, so both would have taken their hard-coded fallback every time. The nested card takes the studio layer's `--border`, and the caption says what it is in the type ramp instead.",
    "display": "block",
    "& [part=\"fields\"]": {
      "display": "flex",
      "flexDirection": "column",
      "gap": "4px",
      "marginBottom": "12px"
    },
    "& [part=\"card\"], & [part=\"nested-card\"]": {
      "border": "1px solid var(--border)",
      "borderRadius": "var(--radius)",
      "padding": "6px 10px"
    },
    "& [part=\"field-row\"]": {
      "display": "flex",
      "alignItems": "center",
      "gap": "8px"
    },
    "& [part=\"field-label\"]": {
      "$description": "The field's name in words: a caption on the row rather than a label for a control, since the raw key beside it is what the reader edits and what carries the accessible name.",
      "flex": "none",
      "minWidth": "84px",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-sm)",
      "color": "var(--fg-dim)",
      "overflowWrap": "anywhere"
    },
    "& [part=\"field-name\"]": {
      "flex": "1",
      "maxWidth": "140px"
    },
    "& [part=\"nested\"]": {
      "marginLeft": "16px",
      "marginTop": "6px",
      "paddingLeft": "8px",
      "borderLeft": "2px solid var(--border)",
      "display": "flex",
      "flexDirection": "column",
      "gap": "4px"
    },
    "& [part=\"ref-target\"]": {
      "display": "flex",
      "marginTop": "6px",
      "maxWidth": "220px"
    },
    "& [part=\"nested-add\"]": {
      "display": "flex",
      "alignItems": "center",
      "gap": "6px",
      "padding": "4px 0"
    },
    "& [part=\"nested-add-name\"]": {
      "flex": "1",
      "maxWidth": "120px"
    },
    "& [part=\"add-form\"]": {
      "display": "flex",
      "alignItems": "center",
      "gap": "8px",
      "padding": "8px 0"
    }
  },
  "children": [
    {
      "tagName": "div",
      "attributes": {
        "part": "fields"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "$prototype": "Array",
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/state/fields"
          },
          "key": {
            "$ref": "$map/item/key"
          },
          "map": {
            "tagName": "div",
            "attributes": {
              "part": "card",
              "data-field": "${$map.item.key}"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "tagName": "div",
                "attributes": {
                  "part": "field-row"
                },
                "children": [
                  {
                    "tagName": "span",
                    "attributes": {
                      "part": "field-label"
                    },
                    "textContent": "${$map.item.label}"
                  },
                  {
                    "tagName": "jx-textfield",
                    "attributes": {
                      "part": "field-name"
                    },
                    "$props": {
                      "label": "Name for ${$map.item.label}",
                      "size": "sm",
                      "value": {
                        "$ref": "$map/item/name"
                      }
                    },
                    "onchange": {
                      "$prototype": "Function",
                      "body": [
                        {
                          "operator": "call",
                          "target": {
                            "$ref": "#/state/renameField"
                          },
                          "value": [
                            {
                              "$ref": "$map/item/key"
                            },
                            {
                              "$ref": "event#/target/value"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "tagName": "jx-select",
                    "attributes": {
                      "part": "field-type"
                    },
                    "$props": {
                      "label": "Type for ${$map.item.label}",
                      "size": "sm",
                      "options": {
                        "$ref": "#/state/typeOptions"
                      },
                      "value": {
                        "$ref": "$map/item/type"
                      }
                    },
                    "onchange": {
                      "$prototype": "Function",
                      "body": [
                        {
                          "operator": "call",
                          "target": {
                            "$ref": "#/state/setType"
                          },
                          "value": [
                            {
                              "$ref": "$map/item/key"
                            },
                            {
                              "$ref": "event#/target/value"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "tagName": "div",
                    "attributes": {
                      "part": "format-slot",
                      "role": "none"
                    },
                    "style": {
                      "display": "contents"
                    },
                    "$switch": {
                      "$ref": "$map/item/hasFormat"
                    },
                    "cases": {
                      "true": {
                        "tagName": "jx-select",
                        "attributes": {
                          "part": "field-format"
                        },
                        "$props": {
                          "label": "Format for ${$map.item.label}",
                          "size": "sm",
                          "options": {
                            "$ref": "#/state/formatOptions"
                          },
                          "value": {
                            "$ref": "$map/item/format"
                          }
                        },
                        "onchange": {
                          "$prototype": "Function",
                          "body": [
                            {
                              "operator": "call",
                              "target": {
                                "$ref": "#/state/setFormat"
                              },
                              "value": [
                                {
                                  "$ref": "$map/item/key"
                                },
                                {
                                  "$ref": "event#/target/value"
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "tagName": "jx-switch",
                    "$description": "Whether the object requires this field. The word on screen is the name: `Req` is slotted rather than passed as `label`, because the kit's switch wraps its control in the label the slot lands in, and a second name would be announced over the top of it. Which row it belongs to is the tooltip's job instead, which is what `hint` is.",
                    "attributes": {
                      "part": "field-required"
                    },
                    "$props": {
                      "hint": "Require ${$map.item.label}",
                      "size": "sm",
                      "checked": {
                        "$ref": "$map/item/required"
                      }
                    },
                    "onchange": {
                      "$prototype": "Function",
                      "body": [
                        {
                          "operator": "call",
                          "target": {
                            "$ref": "#/state/setRequired"
                          },
                          "value": [
                            {
                              "$ref": "$map/item/key"
                            },
                            {
                              "$ref": "event#/target/checked"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "tagName": "span",
                        "textContent": "Req"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "tagName": "jx-action-button",
                    "attributes": {
                      "part": "field-delete"
                    },
                    "$props": {
                      "label": "Delete ${$map.item.label}",
                      "hint": "Delete ${$map.item.label}",
                      "icon": "trash",
                      "quiet": true,
                      "size": "sm"
                    },
                    "onclick": {
                      "$prototype": "Function",
                      "body": [
                        {
                          "operator": "call",
                          "target": {
                            "$ref": "#/state/removeField"
                          },
                          "value": [
                            {
                              "$ref": "$map/item/key"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "tagName": "div",
                "attributes": {
                  "part": "extra-slot",
                  "role": "none"
                },
                "style": {
                  "display": "contents"
                },
                "$switch": {
                  "$ref": "$map/item/extra"
                },
                "cases": {
                  "reference": {
                    "tagName": "div",
                    "attributes": {
                      "part": "ref-target"
                    },
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "tagName": "jx-select",
                        "attributes": {
                          "part": "ref-target-select"
                        },
                        "$props": {
                          "label": "Target for ${$map.item.label}",
                          "size": "sm",
                          "options": {
                            "$ref": "#/state/targets"
                          },
                          "value": {
                            "$ref": "$map/item/refTarget"
                          }
                        },
                        "onchange": {
                          "$prototype": "Function",
                          "body": [
                            {
                              "operator": "call",
                              "target": {
                                "$ref": "#/state/setTarget"
                              },
                              "value": [
                                {
                                  "$ref": "$map/item/key"
                                },
                                {
                                  "$ref": "event#/target/value"
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  "nested": {
                    "tagName": "div",
                    "attributes": {
                      "part": "nested"
                    },
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "$prototype": "Array",
                        "items": {
                          "$ref": "$map/item/children"
                        },
                        "key": {
                          "$ref": "$map/item/key"
                        },
                        "map": {
                          "tagName": "div",
                          "attributes": {
                            "part": "nested-card",
                            "data-nested": "${$map.item.key}"
                          },
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "tagName": "div",
                              "attributes": {
                                "part": "field-row"
                              },
                              "children": [
                                {
                                  "tagName": "jx-textfield",
                                  "attributes": {
                                    "part": "field-name"
                                  },
                                  "$props": {
                                    "label": "Name for ${$map.item.parent}.${$map.item.key}",
                                    "size": "sm",
                                    "value": {
                                      "$ref": "$map/item/name"
                                    }
                                  },
                                  "onchange": {
                                    "$prototype": "Function",
                                    "body": [
                                      {
                                        "operator": "call",
                                        "target": {
                                          "$ref": "#/state/renameNested"
                                        },
                                        "value": [
                                          {
                                            "$ref": "$map/item/parent"
                                          },
                                          {
                                            "$ref": "$map/item/key"
                                          },
                                          {
                                            "$ref": "event#/target/value"
                                          }
                                        ]
                                      }
                                    ]
                                  }
                                },
                                {
                                  "tagName": "jx-select",
                                  "attributes": {
                                    "part": "field-type"
                                  },
                                  "$props": {
                                    "label": "Type for ${$map.item.parent}.${$map.item.key}",
                                    "size": "sm",
                                    "options": {
                                      "$ref": "#/state/typeOptions"
                                    },
                                    "value": {
                                      "$ref": "$map/item/type"
                                    }
                                  },
                                  "onchange": {
                                    "$prototype": "Function",
                                    "body": [
                                      {
                                        "operator": "call",
                                        "target": {
                                          "$ref": "#/state/setNestedType"
                                        },
                                        "value": [
                                          {
                                            "$ref": "$map/item/parent"
                                          },
                                          {
                                            "$ref": "$map/item/key"
                                          },
                                          {
                                            "$ref": "event#/target/value"
                                          }
                                        ]
                                      }
                                    ]
                                  }
                                },
                                {
                                  "tagName": "div",
                                  "attributes": {
                                    "part": "format-slot",
                                    "role": "none"
                                  },
                                  "style": {
                                    "display": "contents"
                                  },
                                  "$switch": {
                                    "$ref": "$map/item/hasFormat"
                                  },
                                  "cases": {
                                    "true": {
                                      "tagName": "jx-select",
                                      "attributes": {
                                        "part": "field-format"
                                      },
                                      "$props": {
                                        "label": "Format for ${$map.item.parent}.${$map.item.key}",
                                        "size": "sm",
                                        "options": {
                                          "$ref": "#/state/formatOptions"
                                        },
                                        "value": {
                                          "$ref": "$map/item/format"
                                        }
                                      },
                                      "onchange": {
                                        "$prototype": "Function",
                                        "body": [
                                          {
                                            "operator": "call",
                                            "target": {
                                              "$ref": "#/state/setNestedFormat"
                                            },
                                            "value": [
                                              {
                                                "$ref": "$map/item/parent"
                                              },
                                              {
                                                "$ref": "$map/item/key"
                                              },
                                              {
                                                "$ref": "event#/target/value"
                                              }
                                            ]
                                          }
                                        ]
                                      }
                                    }
                                  }
                                },
                                {
                                  "tagName": "jx-switch",
                                  "attributes": {
                                    "part": "field-required"
                                  },
                                  "$props": {
                                    "hint": "Require ${$map.item.parent}.${$map.item.key}",
                                    "size": "sm",
                                    "checked": {
                                      "$ref": "$map/item/required"
                                    }
                                  },
                                  "onchange": {
                                    "$prototype": "Function",
                                    "body": [
                                      {
                                        "operator": "call",
                                        "target": {
                                          "$ref": "#/state/setNestedRequired"
                                        },
                                        "value": [
                                          {
                                            "$ref": "$map/item/parent"
                                          },
                                          {
                                            "$ref": "$map/item/key"
                                          },
                                          {
                                            "$ref": "event#/target/checked"
                                          }
                                        ]
                                      }
                                    ]
                                  },
                                  "children": [
                                    {
                                      "tagName": "span",
                                      "textContent": "Req"
                                    }
                                  ]
                                },
                                {
                                  "tagName": "jx-action-button",
                                  "attributes": {
                                    "part": "field-delete"
                                  },
                                  "$props": {
                                    "label": "Delete ${$map.item.parent}.${$map.item.key}",
                                    "hint": "Delete ${$map.item.parent}.${$map.item.key}",
                                    "icon": "trash",
                                    "quiet": true,
                                    "size": "sm"
                                  },
                                  "onclick": {
                                    "$prototype": "Function",
                                    "body": [
                                      {
                                        "operator": "call",
                                        "target": {
                                          "$ref": "#/state/removeNested"
                                        },
                                        "value": [
                                          {
                                            "$ref": "$map/item/parent"
                                          },
                                          {
                                            "$ref": "$map/item/key"
                                          }
                                        ]
                                      }
                                    ]
                                  }
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      },
                      {
                        "tagName": "div",
                        "attributes": {
                          "part": "nested-add"
                        },
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "tagName": "jx-textfield",
                            "attributes": {
                              "part": "nested-add-name"
                            },
                            "$props": {
                              "label": "New field in ${$map.item.label}",
                              "placeholder": "field name",
                              "size": "sm",
                              "value": {
                                "$ref": "$map/item/draftName"
                              }
                            },
                            "oninput": {
                              "$prototype": "Function",
                              "body": [
                                {
                                  "operator": "call",
                                  "target": {
                                    "$ref": "#/state/editDraftName"
                                  },
                                  "value": [
                                    {
                                      "$ref": "$map/item/key"
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "$ref": "event#/target/value"
                                    }
                                  ]
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            "onkeydown": {
                              "$prototype": "Function",
                              "body": [
                                {
                                  "$switch": {
                                    "$ref": "event#/key"
                                  },
                                  "cases": {
                                    "Enter": [
                                      {
                                        "preventDefault": true
                                      },
                                      {
                                        "operator": "call",
                                        "target": {
                                          "$ref": "#/state/addNested"
                                        },
                                        "value": [
                                          {
                                            "$ref": "$map/item/key"
                                          }
                                        ]
                                      }
                                    ]
                                  }
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          },
                          {
                            "tagName": "jx-select",
                            "attributes": {
                              "part": "nested-add-type"
                            },
                            "$props": {
                              "label": "Type of the new field in ${$map.item.label}",
                              "size": "sm",
                              "options": {
                                "$ref": "#/state/typeOptions"
                              },
                              "value": {
                                "$ref": "$map/item/draftType"
                              }
                            },
                            "onchange": {
                              "$prototype": "Function",
                              "body": [
                                {
                                  "operator": "call",
                                  "target": {
                                    "$ref": "#/state/editDraftType"
                                  },
                                  "value": [
                                    {
                                      "$ref": "$map/item/key"
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "$ref": "event#/target/value"
                                    }
                                  ]
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          },
                          {
                            "tagName": "jx-action-button",
                            "attributes": {
                              "part": "nested-add-button"
                            },
                            "$props": {
                              "label": "Add a field to ${$map.item.label}",
                              "hint": "Add a field to ${$map.item.label}",
                              "icon": "plus",
                              "quiet": true,
                              "size": "sm"
                            },
                            "onclick": {
                              "$prototype": "Function",
                              "body": [
                                {
                                  "operator": "call",
                                  "target": {
                                    "$ref": "#/state/addNested"
                                  },
                                  "value": [
                                    {
                                      "$ref": "$map/item/key"
                                    }
                                  ]
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tagName": "div",
      "attributes": {
        "part": "add-slot",
        "role": "none"
      },
      "style": {
        "display": "contents"
      },
      "$switch": {
        "$ref": "#/state/addState"
      },
      "cases": {
        "closed": {
          "tagName": "jx-action-button",
          "attributes": {
            "part": "add-open"
          },
          "$props": {
            "label": "Add Field",
            "icon": "plus",
            "quiet": true,
            "size": "sm"
          },
          "onclick": {
            "$prototype": "Function",
            "body": [
              {
                "operator": "call",
                "target": {
                  "$ref": "#/state/openAdd"
                },
                "value": []
              }
            ]
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "tagName": "span",
              "textContent": "Add Field"
            }
          ]
        },
        "open": {
          "tagName": "div",
          "attributes": {
            "part": "add-form"
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "tagName": "jx-textfield",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "add-name"
              },
              "$props": {
                "label": "New field name",
                "placeholder": "Field name",
                "size": "sm",
                "value": {
                  "$ref": "#/state/addName"
                }
              },
              "oninput": {
                "$prototype": "Function",
                "body": [
                  {
                    "operator": "call",
                    "target": {
                      "$ref": "#/state/editAddName"
                    },
                    "value": [
                      {
                        "$ref": "event#/target/value"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              "onkeydown": {
                "$prototype": "Function",
                "body": [
                  {
                    "$switch": {
                      "$ref": "event#/key"
                    },
                    "cases": {
                      "Enter": [
                        {
                          "preventDefault": true
                        },
                        {
                          "operator": "call",
                          "target": {
                            "$ref": "#/state/confirmAdd"
                          },
                          "value": []
                        }
                      ],
                      "Escape": [
                        {
                          "preventDefault": true
                        },
                        {
                          "operator": "call",
                          "target": {
                            "$ref": "#/state/cancelAdd"
                          },
                          "value": []
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "tagName": "jx-select",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "add-type"
              },
              "$props": {
                "label": "Type of the new field",
                "size": "sm",
                "options": {
                  "$ref": "#/state/typeOptions"
                },
                "value": {
                  "$ref": "#/state/addType"
                }
              },
              "onchange": {
                "$prototype": "Function",
                "body": [
                  {
                    "operator": "call",
                    "target": {
                      "$ref": "#/state/editAddType"
                    },
                    "value": [
                      {
                        "$ref": "event#/target/value"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "tagName": "div",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "add-format-slot",
                "role": "none"
              },
              "style": {
                "display": "contents"
              },
              "$switch": {
                "$ref": "#/state/addHasFormat"
              },
              "cases": {
                "true": {
                  "tagName": "jx-select",
                  "attributes": {
                    "part": "add-format"
                  },
                  "$props": {
                    "label": "Format of the new field",
                    "size": "sm",
                    "options": {
                      "$ref": "#/state/formatOptions"
                    },
                    "value": {
                      "$ref": "#/state/addFormat"
                    }
                  },
                  "onchange": {
                    "$prototype": "Function",
                    "body": [
                      {
                        "operator": "call",
                        "target": {
                          "$ref": "#/state/editAddFormat"
                        },
                        "value": [
                          {
                            "$ref": "event#/target/value"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "tagName": "jx-switch",
              "attributes": {
